    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "HWP Estate Agents are delighted to present; Zephyr Lodge, a charming & large detached family home set on extensive mature grounds (2.7 acres) in a peaceful countryside setting near Kells. \nBuilt in 1870, Zephyr Lodge features three bedrooms, multiple reception rooms, a home office, and a traditional stone barn/workshop, this property offers an exceptional combination of space, character, and versatility.\n\nThe property extends to generous family accommodation throughout and is filled with natural light thanks to its large windows, creating a bright and welcoming atmosphere in every room. The ground floor comprises a well-appointed kitchen, a spacious living room, a separate dining room, and a large family room, providing ample space for both everyday living and entertaining. A utility room, bathroom, and additional storage area complete the downstairs accommodation.\n\nUpstairs, the property offers three well-proportioned bedrooms, a family bathroom, and a dedicated home office.\n\nOutside, Zephyr Lodge enjoys extensive private grounds that surround the house, providing plenty of space for gardening, recreation, or simply enjoying the tranquillity of the countryside. A particular feature of the property is the substantial traditional stone barn/workshop located to the rear. Rich in character and offering excellent versatility, this attractive stone building is ideal for use as a workshop, studio, storage facility, hobby space, or for a variety of other uses subject to any necessary consents.\n\nConveniently located within easy reach of Kells and its full range of schools, shops, cafés, restaurants, and local amenities, Zephyr Lodge offers the perfect balance of peaceful country living and accessibility.\n\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a spacious detached home with extensive grounds and charming features in a highly desirable rural setting.\n\nViewing by Appointment Only."
      },
